      "nextIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Um... my head was a mess just now. Thanks for telling me what was happening on the plane.",
        "zh": "那个......刚才我脑子有点乱，谢谢你告诉我飞机上的事。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Me too. And thank you for getting me out of there.",
        "zh": "我也是，谢谢你带我离开那里。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "From what you’ve said, I can’t just abandon the people on that plane. Let’s part ways here.",
        "zh": "嗯，听你的说法，我不能放着飞机上的人不管，我们就在这里分别吧。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "You’re going back to that plane?",
        "zh": "你还要回那架飞机上去？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "I’m going back to the temple first to see if I can get help, but I can’t just leave those people there to die.",
        "zh": "我会先回道观看看能不能搬到救兵，但总归不能放着那些人等死。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "......",
        "zh": "......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": -1,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Maybe there’s something I can do.",
            "zh": "或许我能帮上忙。",
            "ja": ""
          },
          "targetIndex": 15
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Then take care. I should get going.",
            "zh": "那你保重，我先走了。",
            "ja": ""
          },
          "targetIndex": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Then be careful. Don’t get hurt like that again.",
        "zh": "那你多多保重，千万别像之前一样重伤了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Haha, I’ll be careful. Uh... I’m sure I’ll figure something out.",
        "zh": "哈哈，我会注意点的，呃，应该会有办法吧。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Okay. I still have things to do, so I’ll be on my way.",
        "zh": "嗯，我还有事，先走一步了。",
        "ja": ""
