    {
      "index": 18,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Maybe I can ask around and see if I can find a way out of this mess.",
        "zh": "或许我可以在这里打听一下，看看能不能找到破局的方法。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Oh my god, you’re incredible! I’m terrible at anything that requires thinking!",
        "zh": "天呐！你真是太好了！我最不擅长需要动脑子的事情了！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(Uh... but isn’t your name Page?)",
        "zh": "（呃，但你的名字不是叫周书吗？）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 21
